zalitaya-krovyu-veritelnaya-gramota-name = blood-soaked letter of credence
zalitaya-krovyu-veritelnaya-gramota-desc = A dense, costly sheet of vellum sealed with the Legion's heavy wax seal. The lower edge is torn unevenly. Judging by the marks, powerful jaws bit through the paper along with the courier's satchel. The whole sheet is heavily spattered with brown stains of dried blood, and it smells of raw meat.
zalitaya-krovyu-veritelnaya-gramota-content = [head=3][color=#4682b4]OFFICIAL MISSIVE OF THE IMPERIAL LEGION[/color][/head]


    {"[italic]Gracious lords, most honorable chiefs and elders of this blessed island![/italic]"}


    {"On behalf of the Legion's high command, I have the honor of extending to you our deepest respect. Our outposts have received most intriguing reports concerning your [bold]distinctive[/bold] and secluded culture. Moved by the unchanging ideals of humanism, enlightenment, and progress, we express our sincere desire to establish peaceful, allied, and mutually beneficial relations with your noble people."}


    {"We are wholly convinced that the age of estrangement must pass into oblivion. In exchange for the right of free passage for our expeditions and the founding of a modest trading post upon your shore, the Legion is prepared to bestow upon you first-rate manufactured goods, steel tools, and the benefits of civilization. We hope this will allow you to forever cast aside barbaric privations and [color=#8b0000]██████▓▓▓▒▒▒░░░[/color]"}


    {"The bearer of this letter, Tribune Galerius, is a man of noble blood, exceptional diplomatic restraint, and the highest moral qualities. We remind you that his person is absolutely inviolable. We most humbly ask you to [bold]receive our envoy with all hospitality proper to your tribe[/bold], seat him at your table, and share a meal with him, that a firm foundation may be laid for the future brotherhood of our peoples."}


    {"With perfect respect and in anticipation of a swift meeting,"}

    {"[italic]Legate of Hafen Port.[/italic]"}

gryaznyy-pergament3-name = dirty parchment
gryaznyy-pergament3-desc = A crumpled scrap of leather, charred at the edges and torn from a binding. The handwriting has turned jerky, the letters feverishly leaping, changing size and shape, with some symbols warped as though the writer's hands were failing him. A thick fingerprint of soot and clotted blood sits in the center.
