    {"I f0rged n0 blade. I f0rged a circle. Perfect. With0ut beginning 0r end, like the very throat 0f the v0lcan0. [color=#ffd700]G0ld[/color] fr0m the deep vein5 w0ve it5elf int0 the dark 5teel, like an 0bedient 5erpent. It warm5 my finger. It whi5per5."}


    {"[bold]Azkyanu-nara![/bold] My creati0n... my [italic]prec10u5[/italic]. It i5 heavier than the whole m0untain, and yet I feel light a5 a5h 0n the wind."}


    {"I hear them 5cratching at the d00r. [color=#333333]██▓▒░[/color] They think they can take Him? My trea5ure? My preci0u5? Let them c0me. N0w I 5ee thr0ugh them. I 5ee the 5had0w5 that 5tand behind their back5."}


