raspisannyy-ritualnyy-kalendar-name = marked ritual calendar
raspisannyy-ritualnyy-kalendar-desc = LUG OB GOTH-HAI. THE WILL OF THE GODS IS ONE.


    {"DAWN: TERRA AGH MAGNUS."}

    {"UZG OB TERRA. URUK GIMB MAGNUS."}

    {"The tribe greets mana. Terra grants the fertility of the earth."}


    {"NOON: PYRX AGH VALTOR."}

    {"THRAK OB PYRX. DAGOR OB VALTOR."}

    {"Pyrx grants strength for defense. Valtor calls to slaughter."}


    {"SUNSET: MORBIUS AGH PUSHAT."}

    {"NAMPAT NURZ-U! URUK PUSHAT MAT OB LEGION AGH COLLEGIUM."}

    {"The enemy is slain. The tribe eats flesh. Morbius takes the decay."}


    {"TWILIGHT: ZAYGO AGH NEXAR."}

    {"NURZ GLOB ISHI OCEAN. NEXAR DURB."}

    {"Cast the spoils into the ocean for Zaygo. Drink Nexar's potion for oblivion."}


    {"NIGHT: SOMA AGH BURZUM."}

    {"SOMA GOTH OB GUL. PRAKH ISHI UZG."}

    {"Rest for the ancestors. Soma grants healing to the spirit."}

